16","articyId":"72057821671272737","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"You don't want to know.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't want to know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48903","byteOffset":32841912,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_28C7CF6D","articyId":"72057821671272744","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"And if I do?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And if I do?","TextSheVersion":"And if I do?","TextTheyVersion":"And if I do?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36871","byteOffset":28292560,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_E085C041","articyId":"72057821671273162","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Can you tell me anything about the Old Network?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can you tell me anything about the Old Network?","TextSheVersion":"Can you tell me anything about the Old Network?","TextTheyVersion":"Can you tell me anything about the Old Network?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23825","byteOffset":16893632,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_33EC41B3","articyId":"72057821671273169","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I could tell you enough to risk your life. So I suggest we avoid the subject.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I could tell you enough to risk your life. So I suggest we avoid the subject.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38021","byteOffset":28719536,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_B2382F5B","articyId":"72057821671273177","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Have you ever read a printed book? On paper?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have you ever read a printed book? On paper?","TextSheVersion":"Have you ever read a printed book? On paper?","TextTheyVersion":"Have you ever read a printed book? On paper?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25547","byteOffset":17551064,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_FE433AA9","articyId":"72057821671273184","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I did. Dangerous things they are. Full of uncontrolled life and ideas. Something about the format makes them more tactile... more real.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I did. Dangerous things they are. Full of uncontrolled life and ideas. Something about the format makes them more tactile... more real.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30441","byteOffset":19397752,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_65BC6B76","articyId":"72057821671273191","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"The pages, the wood they were made of: it made them alive, vivid. Ideas crystallized into reality.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pro